      "text": "The model never runs code. It writes the arguments as JSON; you parse them, run the function, and send the result back with the SAME call_id.",
      "originalText": "The model never runs code. It writes the arguments as JSON; you parse them, run the function, and send the result back with the SAME call_id.",
