      "text": "Faster: one model turn instead of two.  Only for INDEPENDENT calls: if call 2 needs call 1's result, the model must wait and call one by one.",
      "originalText": "Faster: one model turn instead of two.  Only for INDEPENDENT calls: if call 2 needs call 1's result, the model must wait and call one by one.",
